:spcPts val="1260"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="900" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:ea typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:cs typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:sym typeface="Poppins Light"/></a:rPr><a:t>All outsourced workers will possess the necessary skills, including ITI diplomas and experience working on live electrical networks. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1260"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="900" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:ea typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:cs typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:sym typeface="Poppins Light"/></a:rPr><a:t>Additionally, they will receive a Group Accidental Cover of INR 5 lakhs, along with all statutory benefits such as Provident Fund and Employee State Insurance.</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="16" name="TextBox 16"/><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="1143502" y="5113147"/><a:ext cx="2105384" cy="157353"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="t"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1176"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Poppins Bold"/><a:ea typeface="Poppins Bold"/><a:cs typeface="Poppins Bold"/><a:sym typeface="Poppins Bold"/></a:rPr><a:t>Consumer</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="17" name="TextBox 17"/><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="1143502" y="5336475"/><a:ext cx="5511962" cy="1427250"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="t"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" lvl="0" indent="0" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1399"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="999" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:ea typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:cs typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:sym typeface="Poppins Light"/></a:rPr><a:t>Prompt Resolution of Complaints </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" lvl="0" indent="0" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1399"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="999" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:ea typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:cs typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:sym typeface="Poppins Light"/></a:rPr><a:t>Consumers will receive real-time updates regarding the progress of their Fault Rectification Vehicle, similar to services like Uber or Ola, allowing them to see how far away it is and the estimated time of arrival. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" lvl="0" indent="0" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1399"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="999" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:ea typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:cs typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:sym typeface="Poppins Light"/></a:rPr><a:t>All current individual complaints will be addressed within two hours of registration.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" lvl="0" indent="0" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1399"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="999" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:ea typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:cs typeface="Poppins Light"/><a:sym typeface="Poppins Light"/></a:rPr><a:t>For rural consumers, complaint resolutions will adhere to the established SOP timelines. Acknowledgment of resolved complaints will be obtained from consumers to prevent any incorrect closures.</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree></p:cSld><p